      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2af4a0d37dac223ac761e24b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "待兼福来",
      "source_fingerprint": "450312998b7d6fb0a089dc279e6d298f30c5ff5f9aab8f2fff270531c79cc6a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02c1590f891d13bea9743213",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天我必须在这里说这句话才行。\n“在菊花舞台后，福气也来到中山了”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f11c27743c50f01fb9967df6e37f4d53fa03bd2a46827c9b961e3c3bf145a10",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02d56b0b08e6d034ff300049",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有马纪念结束后・福来今至",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea0017383804b7a18b1ecdc71118969651342cdb6e563f3d6f541576afdde0f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79a6cacb3afe7828bf28adb7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄道吉日……待兼福来\n在这天获得了许多幸运。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e77ac9460706bfc43eeff01fe9cfe5d3304d177834477d554e8ef17c5865899",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8adc98200eae1c37149f11e1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "认为这是Shiraoki大人旨意的她，\n面向闪耀系列赛\n展开了活动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fddb8268c0fd4f9efb3777019f36e396d98a50d6c9e0c5f01e84320c382fae69",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38cf07bd93cb0c38424531ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "待兼福来登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "187d513be7277dffbd213f70a89b4050c7c10aa20f9ae9f200562f15dc2aa8f2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4aaca23cfbb60ac7218d0bc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "待兼福来对于自己是否能好好跑完\n“日本德比”感到不安，\n于是前往神社祈求神明保佑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "829645fe87c369ebd22e16a95c64b7626f861aa879205fa56330de49855035e0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f4993cec138b6b0efe1c09a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "结果……她在那里碰巧遇见了\n也会参加“日本德比”的无声铃鹿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b461c548e5d07e6cfea73ee76784bb8e2d9bddbcf56b48523bfc6985023358f6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59aa1448a9a9fbbdeb437dcf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿之所以前来参拜，是希望自己\n能好好努力，不被“日本德比”的魔物吞噬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96688aea870b8732087edefb4992fbe0527315dc9dfcd81e274b99344349cef0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70cb1a487b95355155719933",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "待兼福来因此得知具有才华的她\n也会在意竞争对手的情况。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8c769fa79f6159406623273ed13bed9bdab3f6e9e9a0fb6df7eb86e3704c97f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccd2104f86ddd2204a52840c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "觉得心情变得较轻松的待兼福来，\n便与无声铃鹿一起向神明\n献上祈祷了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ada8d585c5083890117f408feae4b633653dd6d042565497668d33bbedee0fd1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0b492e01b654ba47b61b00c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比幽灵更可怕的东西！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9959e17a0abdd24ed03f250cb85c148a77b587030a98d11fc1c859ac3dd83aab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:388f5202d2f28f95ced8e00a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "待兼福来决定参加“菊花赏”，\n但从未经历过的长距离竞赛\n让她感到不安。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca074cde9e0a550acedebbff9735bde688dac9301962076008633c43eae2162b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b68753a58ec500de0da278f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "很担心待兼福来状况的无声铃鹿\n便对她说了一些话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b34818805b808177eac0911c266b9d0e9409cd6ab7d5948b6cc5748c9de8d11e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3866083adbd2297333c643d1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她说待兼福来\n比自己所想的还厉害，\n所以应该对自己更有信心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "18c71817999dc9a348cb784e9f2591bb06e9889627c773053b0b5b6196de5629",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:448fa602829f9e9b393da92d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "待兼福来因为这句话获得勇气，\n决定在“菊花赏”好好努力一番，\n态度变得较积极了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d162a48fa59fa856d795fcdf2aee7d166778efc5db4918fd6f2974d8ebecd5f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:321992f17f6f37ddefd85f4b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "梦的分歧点",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0ba9d353efd48f6de4d555383e99ad792159711eed91f326688825fa5d47589",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c64b3f394355ca4673097c3b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "待兼福来在“金鯱赏”的表现\n被杂志报导评为“糟透了”，\n陷入了前所未有的低潮中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b94df26e9ba88bceda267455c22f55f4bb162293b83ab606b8e7f81f7c2c561",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ead410fac6137b1dd554648",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "待兼福来很后悔自己一直依靠运气在奔跑，\n说想要向粉丝表示歉意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a4e3195c5752557bb0752334fbcc323efeb503bc47a18913c097c419acfe19b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5fd09dfde86de39773c51ac",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她预定要参加的下一场比赛，\n是由粉丝投票选出来的“宝冢纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fcf431584cd98055672cd7c287802f269db6fb66d382399e3e5c9ca3206c4c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056403.json",
